Z||000000||Kasdan||10-27-2001||10:29 AM||||OK, my freshly rebuilt 2.8's idle is all over the place.  well, not really.  It ranges from ~500 to ~1500.  then it finds an idle at ~100 and stays there for a while, then starts jumping around again.  Its not throwing any codes, so what could it be?<P>------------------<BR>Tyler Morgan, 1986 GT<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero21.jpg">            <BR>Aftermarket Power Steering, Rebuilt motor with &gt;100 miles!<BR>Aim=FieroDriver1986||||reg||1
